# Copy to .env and keep it private (git-ignored). `node --env-file-if-exists=.env` loads it.
# Optional: decide through the Anthropic API (official SDK). If unset, the agent falls back to the
# Claude Code CLI (`claude -p`, no tools) with the same model.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
HANDY_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# The Sparta runner supplies WORLDS_BASE_URL / WORLDS_API_KEY / WORLDS_TASK_JSON. Never put real Stripe keys here.
